# The propensive libraries this repository builds against: one per line, tab-separated, as
# `repository  version  [commit]`. A version `X.Y.Z` is a GitHub Release; `X.Y.Z-<12 hex>` is a
# snapshot of an unreleased build, published by `make snapshot` in that repository (the commit
# column says which commit), and a release here is refused while one is pinned. The
# build reads this file (`deps` in build.mill); `make sync-deps` and CI install what it names.
# See propensive/.github for the whole flow.
#
# The `lira` tool and the LIRA format modules beneath it (`src/format` and its siblings, which were
# Soundness's `reliquary` until they moved here) depend on Soundness alone; the tool is NOT a
# Pyrocosm application, so Soundness is the only pin. The flair plugin and fume, which this
# repository merely runs, are tools rather than dependencies: see etc/tools.
